      "id": "claim_fa425a247e03478cbcf14d6a875a2a4b",
      "statement": "Spring MVC uses a different ConversionService to the one used to convert values from your application.properties or application.yaml file. It means that Period, Duration and DataSize converters are not available and that @DurationUnit and @DataSizeUnit annotations will be ignored.",
