    {
      "id": "claim_de45e2a16fe741d0b9abaf2980ea54d3",
      "statement": "If you want to customize the ConversionService used by Spring MVC, you can provide a WebMvcConfigurer bean with an addFormatters method. From this method you can register any converter that you like, or you can delegate to the static methods available on ApplicationConversionService.",
